<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Loma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ya Paoli kwa wanhu wa Loma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Waloma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lom</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa ya Paoli kwa wanhu wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Loma</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Waloma hanji nachandichigwa na mtumigwa Paoli mhela wa makumi gahano na zine na mhela wa makumi gahano na nane loyavumbuche Yesu. Mbaka aho, Paoli nayang'halifika Loma, ila nakahilika baluwa kuwalajiza wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Loma, weng'ha wawele Wayahudi na hawawele Wayahudi. Nakandika baluwa ayi yawele kuli muji wa Kolinto koyawele yochikala mhela awo. Paoli nakandika baluwa ayi yogana wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wamkunde na kumhulichiza Yesu Kilistu (Waloma 16:26).</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Waloma ndo chitanganiche kwa wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu chila honhu na chila mhela, kwa vila ndaze Paoli vyonayaliyotang'hula goya na hazelu kuwala ulohozi uwele wokuya kwa kukolela Yesu Kilistu. Paoli kahi nakalonga honhu hanji kwa kuwhaniza Ilagano lya Katali na Mbuli Inojile ya Yesu Kilistu. Wasomile wenji wa mbuli ya Bibiliya wangukunda kota msitali utanganiche kuli chitabu achi ndo sula ya 1:16 ulingulonga, “Hambe ndiyonele soni Mbuli Inojile, kwa vila ina ludali lwa Nguluwi lulingigala ulohozi, kwa chila munhu yalingukunda, mwaluko kwa Wayahudi na hamba kwa Myunani.” Honhu ha mwaluko ha chitabu cha Waloma (Waloma 1-11), ndo hawele honhu halingulangusa ng'hatu mbuli ya Nguluwi na honhu ha keli ha chitabu achi (Waloma 12-15) hana ulonzi ulinguwala madito ama kikala kwa Kikilistu kwa madito kuli ukomu wa heye.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Paoli kangwaluka baluwa kwa kizelesa yuye na kulonga whaani yalinguwandichila (Waloma 1:1-15).</para>
  <para style="io">2. Hamba kangwandika mbuli ya chiwunhu hela na wula ulohozi ulinguya kwa kukolela kwa Yesu Kilistu (Waloma 1:16-11:36).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Kumala kwa aga Paoli kangulavya malajizo menji kwa madito kwa chiwalo cha kikala kwa wanhu walingumkunda Yesu Kilistu (Waloma 12:1-15:13).</para>
  <para style="io">4. Paoli kangusinda kwandika baluwa kwa Waloma kwa kulavya ulamso kwa wanhu wawele mli chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Loma (Waloma 16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Heni Paoli, chitumagwa wa Yesu Kilistu, Nguluwi nakanyhema ndiwe mtumigwa na kuwichigwa chiuyeng'ha leka ndiwadamlile wanhu Mbuli Inojile ya heye.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Aho katali, Nguluwi nakalagana na wanhu kwa Mbuli Inojile kwa kukolela waloli wa heye kuli Maandiko Matakatifu. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Ayi Mbuli Inojile ya heni yangumdamla Mwana wa Nguluwi, Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu, yawele kuwala uwunhu wa heye, nayali mlelwa wa Daudi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />kuwala ukulu wa heye, nakatawizwa yawe Mwana wa Nguluwi kwa ludali lwa Muhe Yelile kwa kuzilipulwa kulawa kwa wabagame. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Kwa nzila ya heye, tubochela kunoga kwa heye tuwe watumigwa kwa chiwalo cha Kilistu, leka tuwadite wanhu wa isi zinji leka wakunde na kuhulichiza. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Hemwe mweng'ha mwa mli wanhu awo, mchemigwa muwe wanhu wa heye Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Lelo, ndanguwandichilani hemwe mweng'ha muli ako Loma mlinguganigwa na Nguluwi, nakawabagula muwe wanhu wa heye. Ndanguwaganilani igano na kikala goya kulawa kwa Nguluwi Mhaza wa hetwe na Mkulu Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malumbo kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Nding'hali kwaluka geng'ha, ndanguta malumbo Nguluwi wa heni kwa kukolela Yesu Kilistu kwa hemwe mweng'ha, kwa vila makundo ga hemwe gangudamligwa na wanhu weng'ha kuli isi yeng'ha. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Nguluwi yondilingumfugamila kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha kuli kudamla Mbuli Inojile ya Mwana wa heye, ndo mlolezi wa heni kota heni hambe ndikusemweni, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />chila zuwa hondimlanda Nguluwi. Ndangumlanda Nguluwi wone yagane, yamhe mhela unojile wa kuya kwa hemwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Mina nangana ng'hatu ndikoneni ndiwagawileni ndolendole za chimuhe za kuwakangaza. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Gondilingulonga hano, weng'ha heni na hemwe tikangaze. Makundo ga hemwe gong'hangaza heni na makundo ga heni gokukangazani hemwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Hemwe wang'holozangu, ndangugana mvizele hino, nangana kukujendelani, ila mbaka sambi ndemezwa. Nangana wanhu wamkunde Nguluwi hali hemwe kota vyomhatile wanhu hali wanhu wa isi zinji. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Namhegwa mijito ja kuwadamlila wanhu weng'ha, Wagilichi na hawawele Wagilichi, wawele na luhala na wasowile luhala. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ndo mina heni ndangugana ng'hatu kuidamla Mbuli Inojile kwa hemwe mlingikala ako Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludali lwa Mbuli Inojile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Hambembone soni kudamla Mbuli Inojile, kwa vila ina mong'ho wa Nguluwi ilinguwalohola weng'ha walingukunda. Wawe Wayahudi na wala hawawele Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Kwa vila Mbuli Inojile yangulajila hazelu Nguluwi vyoyawele nguwadita wanhu watanganiche kwa heye, wanhu wanguwa ahi kwa kukunda, kulawila mwaluko mbaka kuduma, kota vyogandichigwe. “Munhu yatanganiche kochikala kwa makundo.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wihe wa wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Nguluwi kalajila kuzudila kwa heye kulawila kilanga, iwalawile weng'ha walingumbeza Nguluwi na kudita gehile wala weng'ha walingudita kukomya kuleche kuzeleka. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Kwa vila, geng'ha gala galinguzeleka kwa chiwalo cha Nguluwi ndo gahazelu kwa hewo, kwa vila heye Nguluwi nakagadita gazeleche kwa hewo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Kulawila zuwa lila Nguluwi vyoyalumbile isi, ludali lwa heye lwa mazuwa gose na ukulu wa heye, hanga hambevyoneche kwa meho, vyanguzeleka ng'hatu. Wanhu woweza kuzizela mbuli azo kwa vinhu avyo vyoyalumbile Nguluwi. Ahyo wahela nzila ya kilewela. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Hanga wavizela hana Nguluwi, ila hambewamtogole vyoilinguganigwa ne kulonga malumbo. Lelo chowalingijesa nachali chaupoka na nhumbula za hewo ziwa nhitu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Wangidaya wana luhala aku wawele wapoka. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Waleka kumtogola Nguluwi yalingikala mazuwa gose, ila wangujifugamila jimalukolo jiwhanile na wanhu walingubagama, jiwhanile kota migongolo na videje ama migongolo jilumbigwe jilingutambala.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Ahyo, Nguluwi nakawaleka wawinze maya gehile ga nhumbula za hewo na kudita mbuli za soni mli ng'huli za hewo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Wangugalamla kukomya kwa Nguluwi kwa udesi, wanguvitogola na wanguvifugamila vinhu vilumbigwe na Nguluwi, ila hawalingumtogola heye yalumbile yalinguganigwa kutogoligwa mazuwa gose! Ena.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Kwa vila wangudita ahyo, Nguluwi nakawaleka wawinze gala gehile. Nawo wadala wa hewo nawaleka kuwasa na walume kota vyowalumbigwe, wangigana hewo kwa hewo. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Nawo walume nawadita hiho, nawaleka kuwasa na wadala kota vyowalumbigwe, wangigana hewo kwa hewo. Wangiditila mbuli za soni walume kwa walume, ahyo naweyambuza wawo kugazigwa kwa gala gehile ga hewo gowaditile.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kwa vila wanhu nawalema kumzela Nguluwi, Nguluwi nakawaleka wawinze luhala lwa hewo lwajilile, nawadita gala hawaganigwe kudita. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Wanhu awa nawamema wihe na kubunza na maya na ubuhu. Nawamema fihi na kukopola na kilewa na uhadi na kuwifya na kuheha <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />na kulonga vinhu vihile kwa wanhu wanji, ndo wanhu wa kuzudiza kwa Nguluwi, wajuvi na wana mnvinvi na kidaya na wadaha ng'hatu kudita gehile na hambe wawahulichize wahaza wa hewo, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />wahela luhala na hambe webate ilagano na hawanojile ne kuwonela isungu wanhu wanji. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Wanguvizela kota kuli malajizo ga Nguluwi gangulonga wanhu walingudita vinhu kota avyo, wanguganigwa kubagama. Mzidi wa ago, haiwele hela wangudita mbuli azo wawo, ila kuno wanguwatogola wanhu walingudita mbuli azo.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Utaguso wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Lelo, goloko wa heni, wone kwanguwatagusa wanji, huweza hebu kilewela, hanga hegwe uwe whaani. Kwa vila, vyouwatagusa kwa wihe wanhu wanji, aku nagwe uchipanjila kwa gala gowalingudita hewo nagwe kwangudita. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Lelo tuvizela utaguso wa Nguluwi kwa wanhu walingudita mbuli kota azo ndo wa kukomya. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ila hegwe goloko ulinguwatagusa wanhu walingudita mbuli kota azo na kahila nagwe kwangudita, ndaze, kwangiijesa kota kochiwika kutali na utaguso wa Nguluwi? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Ama kwangubeza kunoga kwa heye kukulu, kubeteza kwa heye ne kuvizela kota kunoga kwa heye kwangugana kukulongoza umgalamchile Nguluwi kwa kulonga gehile? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ila hegwe uwele na nhumbula igagadale na ulingubeza kuleka gehile, ahyo kwangiyonjezela gwegwe magazo kwa zuwa lila lya kuzudila mhela wula utaguso wa hachi ya Nguluwi loufika. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Zuwa alyo Nguluwi komlipa chila munhu kwa chila nachoyaditile. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Wala wanhu walingulutilila kudita ganojile, aku wopala ukulu na koneka wana lutogo lwa Nguluwi na kuleka kubagama, wanhu awa Nguluwi kowapa ukomu wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Ila wala wamwe walingigana wawo yeng'ha, walingulema mbuli zinojile na kuwinza gehile, ndangukomya Nguluwi kowatagusa kwa ng'halazi ya heye. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Magazo na usungu womuyila chila munhu yawele na wihe. Mwaluko gowafika Wayahudi hamba kahi kwa wanhu wa isi zinji. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ila Nguluwi kowapa ukulu na katogo na kikala goya kwa wala walingudita ganojile. Mwaluko gowafika Wayahudi hamba kahi kwa wanhu wa isi zinji. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Mina Nguluwi hambe yambagule munhu yoneche.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Wala walingudita gehile ne kugazela malajizo ga Musa wokwaga walihela malajizo. Wala walingudita gehile aku wagazelele malajizo ga Musa, wotaguswa kwa malajizo. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Kwa vila hawawele wala walinguhulika malajizo ga Musa ndo wala walingukundigwa na Nguluwi, ila wala walinguhulichiza malajizo ndo wokundigwa hali Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ena, wanhu wa isi zinji wahela malajizo ga Musa, ila howokweneza chila chiliguganigwa kuli malajizo, hewo wanguwa chipimilo cha malajizo hali hewo hanga hawagazelele malajizo ga Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Mbuli za hewo zowalingudita zangulajila kota galinguganigwa na malajizo nagandichigwa mnhumbula za hewo. Nhumbula za hewo zangutawiza kuwala mbuli ayo, mina majesa ga hewo mhela unji kanguwalonjeleza na mhela unji ganguwalewela. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Ahyo, golawila zuwa lya utaguso hala Nguluwi kukolela Yesu Kilistu hoyotagusa mbuli za uviso za wanhu, kota vyondilingudamula Mbuli Inojile.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi na malajizo ga hewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Nagwe ndaze? Wone kwangichema gwegwe Myahudi, kwangitumbila malajizo kwangidaila kwa munhu wa Nguluwi, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />kwa nzila ya malajizo kuvizela chila choyalingugana Nguluwi udite na koweza kuhagula mbuli inojile, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />hegwe kwangiwona kwa chilongozi wa wanhu wohambe walole na lumuli lwa wanhu wawele kutitu, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />wone hegwe kwa mlangusa wa wapoka na wala hawanavizela malanguso, kwangijesa kuli malajizo kwanawo uwanzi weng'ha na kukomya. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Lelo, hegwe kwanguwalangusa wanji, lekachoni hambe wilanguse gwegwe uliyeng'ha? Kwanguwadamlila wanji waleche kuhiza, ila hegwe nagwe kwanguhiza. <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Kwangulonga, “Mleche kudita ung'hondwa,” kuno hegwe udita ung'hondwa, kwangujizudila jimalukolo ja milungu ja udesi na kuno hegwe kwangupata lufufu kwa kuhiza kuli ng'handa azo za milungu. <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Kwangidaila malajizo ga Nguluwi, hambi hegwe hulingumbeza Nguluwi kwa kulema kuwinza malajizo ga heye? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Kota vila Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga, “Wanhu wa isi zinji nawaliliga itagwa lya Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha hemwe Wayahudi.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Kwinjila ikumbi ndo chowa chinhu chinojile wone wibatilile malajizo. Ila wone hulingibatilila malajizo, lelo, kwinjila ikumbi kwa hegwe hakuwele chinhu. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Wone munhu wa isi zinjii yawele henjile ikumbi wone yadite kota malajizo vyogalingugana, ndikomya kojesigwa kota munhu yenjile ikumbi. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Wanhu wa isi zinji wokutagusa hegwe Myahudi wone hibatilile malajizo, hanga kwanago malajizo gandichigwe na kwinjila ikumbi, ila hewo wangibatilila malajizo hanga hawenjile ikumbi. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ndo kulonga, haiwele chila munhu yalingoneka kwa kunze Myahudi ndo Myahudi wa kukomya, ne munhu howa Myahudi wa kukomya wone yenjile ikumbi chilukuli. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Myahudi wa kukomya ndo yula yawele Myahudi wa mgati, yani yula yenjile ikumbi mnhumbula. Ayi ndo mbuli ya Muhe na haiwele mbuli ya malajizo gandichigwe. Munhu yawele ahyo kangutogoligwa, haiwele kwa wanhu, ila kulawa kwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Lelo, Myahudi kana chinhu chachi cha mzidi kusinda wanhu wanji? Ama kwinjila ikumbi kuna chinhu chachi cha mzidi? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Ena, kuna chinhu cha mzidi chila ubanzi. Mwaluko, Nguluwi nakawapa Wayahudi usenga wa heye. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ila yowa ndaze wone wayawo wamwe hawawele wa kukundigwa? Ndaze, mbuli ayi yokusa kukundigwa kwa Nguluwi? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ne hado! Nguluwi kopona wa kukundigwa mazuwa gose, hanga chila munhu ndo mdesi. Kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“Chila vyoulonga, ulonzi wa hegwe ndo wa kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">na kuli utaguso, hegwe kwangusumya.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ila, wone gehile ga hetwe gangulajila kota Nguluwi kangudita ganojile, lelo tulonje choni? Ndaze, tulonje Nguluwi kanguwifya wone yatutaguse? Aha ndangulonga chiwunhu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Ne hado! Wone na iwe ahyo, Nguluwi yahawataguse ndaze wanhu wa isi?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />“Munhu koweza kuuza, wone udesi wa heni wangonjeza kukomya kwa Nguluwi na wangonjeza ukulu wa heye, lelo lekachoni ndangutagusigwa ndina gehile?” <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Ndo kihwana nakulonga. Tudite gehile leka tupegwe ganojile! Ndo wanji vyowatubezile kwa kutulonjeleza hetwe twangulangusa mbuli azo. Wotagusigwa kota vyoilingulapigwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haduhuli munhu yoneche yawele yatanganiche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Tulonje choni, lelo? Ndaze, hetwe Wayahudi ndo natutanganika kusinda wanhu wanji? Ne hado! Kwa vila nandiwalonjelani aho mwaluko, kuta Wayahudi na wanhu wa isi zinji weng'ha wana gehile. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">“Haduhuli ne yumwe yawele yatanganiche!<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Haduhuli munhu ne yumwe yavizelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">ne yumwe yalingumpala Nguluwi.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Weng'ha wajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">weng'ha wana gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">haduhu ne yumwe yaditile ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">haduhuli ne yumwe.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Mimelo ja hewo ndo kota chilaga chilimwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">myango za hewo zangulonga udesi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Mumlomo mwa hewo mwangulawa ulonzi uwele na dunga kota ya izoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Mgati mwa milomo ja hewo mmema upanjilo uwele usungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Magulu ga hewo gangubilimila kukopola,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />honeche howoluta wangwambuza kubagama na magazo,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />hawavizelele kikala goya.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Mbuli ya kumdumba Nguluwi ya haduhu ng'hatu kwa hewo.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Lelo tuvizela kuta malajizo ga Musa ganguwalapa wanhu wala wawele na malajizo ago, ne chila munhu yaleche kigombela, isi yeng'ha yotagusigwa na Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ahyo haduhu munhu yoneche yalinguwazigwa katanganika ama kanoga hali Nguluwi kwa kudita vyogalingugana malajizo, kwa vila malajizo gangumlajila munhu kugazela gehile.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukundigwa na Nguluwi kwa makundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ila lelo, Nguluwi nakaidita nzila ya heye ya kuwadita wanhu wawe watanganiche hali heye izeleche. Nzila ayi hailingitumbila malajizo. Vivyo du vitabu vyandichigwe na Musa na vya waloli, vyangutawiza vinhu avi. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Nguluwi kanguwakunda wanhu wawe watanganiche hali heye kwa kumkunda Yesu Kilistu, Nguluwi kangudita ahyo kwa wanhu weng'ha walingumkunda Kilistu, kuduhuli kibagula koneche. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Wanhu weng'ha nawadita gehile na ukulu wa Nguluwi naumala kwa hewo. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Ila kwa ndolendole ya utambichizo wa Nguluwi, wanhu weng'ha wangukundigwa wawe watanganiche kwa kukolela kwa Yesu Kilistu yalinguwagombola. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Nguluwi nakamlavya Yesu Kilistu kwa danda ya heye, yawe nzila ya kuwosela wanhu gehile ga hewo kwa makundo ga hewo kwa heye. Nakadita ahyo leka yalajile heye kuta katanganika. Aho katali Nguluwi nayali yokwimilila ne kuwagaza wanhu kwa gehile gowaditile, <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />sambi, mhela awu, kanguwinza gehile ga wanhu yawalajile kutanganika kwa heye. Mina heye Nguluwi kanoga na kangumdita munhu yoneche yatanganiche yalingumkunda Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Lelo, toweza kidayila choni? Haduhu! Lekachoni? Ndaze, kwa chiwalo cha kweneza malajizo? Hebu! Ila kwa vila twangukunda. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Mina Nguluwi kangumkunda munhu yawe yatanganiche kwa makundo, ila haiwele kwa kibata malajizo ga Musa. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ama ndaze, Nguluwi ndo Nguluwi wa Wayahudi waliyeka, Ndaze, heye hawele Nguluwi wa wanhu wanji? Ena, heye ndo Nguluwi wa wanhu wa isi zinji kahi. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Nguluwi ndo yumwe, naye nakawadita Wayahudi wawe watanganiche kwa makundo ga hewo na wanhu wa isi zinji kahi kwa makundo ga hewo. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Ndaze, twanguwika malajizo hafungo mwa makundo aga? Ne hado, ila twanguwinza malajizo.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Abulahamu kakundigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Lelo tulonje choni, kuwala Abulahamu mhaza wa hetwe? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Kwa vila Abulahamu nakawazigwa kota yatanganiche kwa gala goyaditile, lelo, kanacho chinhu cha kidayila hali Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Mina Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga, “Abulahamu nakamkunda Nguluwi, naye Nguluwi nakamkunda kota katanganika.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Chinhu choyalingupegwa kwa mijito joyakolile, haiwele mzidi ila ndo hachi ya heye. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ila wone munhu hambe yetumbile madito ga heye, ila kangumkunda Nguluwi yalinguwalechela wehile gehile gowaditile, lelo, Nguluwi kangukunda makundo ga munhu ayo, nakamkunda kota katanganika. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Daudi naye nakalonga ahi kuwala kusangalala kwa munhu yula yawele Nguluwi nakamkunda kota katanganika ne kulola madito ga heye,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Wobweda wala woselwe gehile gowaditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">wawele wihe wa hewo nawusigwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Kobweda munhu yula yawele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:8">Mkulu Nguluwi hambe yakumbuchile gehile ga heye!”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Ndaze, ako kutambichizwa ndo kwa wala wenjile hela ikumbi, ama kahi na kwa wala hawenjile ikumbi? Ndo na wala hawenjile ikumbi. Kwa vila natulonga, “Abulahamu nakakunda, naye Nguluwi nakamkunda kota katanganika.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Ndaze, Abulahamu nakakundigwa yang'hali kwinjila ikumbi, ama loyenjile ikumbi? Nakakundigwa loyang'hali kwinjila ikumbi na haiwele loyenjile ikumbi. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Abulahamu nakenjila ikumbi hamba na kwinjila ikumbi ako nakwali ulajilo wa kulajila kuta Nguluwi nakamkunda kota katanganika kwa chiwalo cha makundo ga heye goyawele nago loyang'hali kwinjila ikumbi. Ahyo, Abulahamu kawa mhaza wa wanhu walingumkunda Nguluwi hanga hawenjile ikumbi, leka wakundigwe na Nguluwi kota watanganika kwa heye. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Vivila Abulahamu ka mhaza wa wanhu wenjile ikumbi, ila haiwele kwa kwinjila ikumbi yeka, leka kwa vila wanguwinza nzila ya makundo ga mhaza wa hetwe Abulahamu nayoyawele nayo naloyang'hali kwinjila ikumbi.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilagano lya Nguluwi lyangubocheligwa kwa makundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Nguluwi nakalagana na Abulahamu na walelwa wa heye kota isi yeng'ha yahawele ya hewo. Ilagano alyo halikoleche kwa vila Abulahamu nakagahulichiza malajizo vyogalonjile, ila kwa vila nakakunda, nakakundigwa kuta katanganika. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Kwa vila wone wopegwa ago goyalagane Nguluwi ndo wanhu wala walingibatilila malajizo hela, lelo, makundo gahela mana yoneche, nalyo ilagano lya Nguluwi haliwele chinhu. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Malajizo gangwambuza kuzudila kwa Nguluwi, ila wone kuduhu malajizo nahakwalinguwa na wihe.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Kwa chiwalo acho, mbuli ayi yangitumbila makundo, ahyo ndo ilagano alyo naliwa kwa chiwalo cha igano lya Nguluwi kwa ivyazi lyeng'ha lya Abulahamu, haiwele kwa wala walingibatilila malajizo waliyeng'ha, ila vivila kwa wala walingikala kwa makundo kota vyonayekale Abulahamu. Heye ndo mhaza wa hetwe tweng'ha. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogali ngulonga, “Nandikuhagula uwe mhaza wa wanhu wa isi nyiji.” Ilagano lino lyakukomya hali Nguluwi yakundigwe na Abulahamu. Nguluwi yalinguwapa ukomu wabagame na vinhu vilikuduhu vyanguwakuko. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Abulahamu nakakunda na kitumbila hanga nakwali kuduhu ne chinhu cha kitumbila, ahyo kawa mhaza wa wanhu wa isi nyinji kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga, “Lulelo lwa hegwe lowa lwinji kota nhondwe!” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Abulahamu nayali sekulu behi wa miyaka miya imwe, ila makundo ga heye hagapunguche hanga yavizelele kota lukuli lwake luwa kota lubagama, kahi mchewake Sala, nayali mhende. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Abulahamu nahawele na majesa na ilagano lya Nguluwi, ila nakawa na ludali kwa makundo ga heye, ahyo nakamtogola Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Nakavizela ng'hatu kota Nguluwi kanguweza kukola gala goyalagane. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ahyo kwa makundo ga heye Nguluwi nakamtawiza Abulahamu kota katanganika. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Ila mbuli ayi, “Nakamkunda kota katanganika,” Handichilwe hebu yuye yeng'ha. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Mbuli ayi kwa chiwalo cha hetwe tuwele twangumkunda Nguluwi yamzilipule Yesu Mkulu wa hetwe, kulawa kwa wabagame. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Heye nakalavigwa yabagame kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hetwe, hamba nakazilipulwa leka tuwe watanganiche.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kutanganika hali Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Lelo, kwa vila tuditigwa tuwe watanganiche kwa makundo, lelo twangikala goya na heye Nguluwi kwa kukolela Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Kwa makundo ga hetwe, Yesu nakatigala kuli kunoga kwa heye Nguluwi motulingikala sambi. Lelo, twangidaila kitumbila kotuwele nako kwa kihanza kuli ukulu wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ena, haiwele ago hela, kahi twangusangalala mli magazo ga hetwe, tuvizela magazo gangigala ubetezo, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />nako kubeteza kwangigala kukundigwa na kukundigwa kwangigala kitumbila. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Kitumbila hambe kutubade, mina Nguluwi nakatujidila mnhumbula za hetwe igano lyake kukolela Muhe Yelile yatupele hetwe.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Lotwali hela ludali, mhela Nguluwi loyauhagule lowuyile, Kilistu nakabagama kwa chiwalo cha wihe wa hetwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Haiwele ubewe kwa munhu kubagama kwa chiwalo cha munhu yatanganiche, ila hanji munhu kobagama kwa chiwalo cha munhu yanojile. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ila Nguluwi nakalajila kangutugana, mina lotwali tung'hali na gehile, Kilistu nakabagama kwa chiwalo cha hetwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Kwa vila sambi tuditigwa tuwe watanganiche kwa danda ya Kilistu, ndo yangoneka ng'hatu kotulohola kulawa kuli kuzudila kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Mina, lotwali tung'hali wang'honyo wa heye, Nguluwi nakatuhanyisa na heye kwa kubagama kwa Mwana wa heye. Kwa vila lelo natuhanyiswa na heye, yangulajila ng'hatu toloholigwa kwa ukomu wa Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Ila haiwele ago yeng'ha, ila twangusechelela kahi kuli Nguluwi kwa kukolela kwa Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu yula yatuhanyise na Nguluwi.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Kwakukolela munhu yumwe gehile nagenjila muisi, nago nagambuza kubagama. Ahyo kubagama nakwenela kuli wanhu weng'ha, kwa vila weng'ha nawadita gehile. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Lokung'hali kuwa na malajizo, gehile galikuko muisi yeng'ha, ila gehile hambe gawazigwe kuli kukumbuchila ne malajizo. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ila kwaluchila mhela wa Adamu mbaka mhela wa Musa, kubagama nakulongoza na wala hawaditile gehile kota ga Adamu, ga kumhinduka Nguluwi. Adamu nakewhana na Kilistu yawele nakoya hamba. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ila wihe wa Adamu hauwhanile na utambichizo wa Nguluwi. Mina, hanga gehile ga munhu yumwe nagambuza kubagama kwa wanhu weng'ha, kwa isungu lya munhu yumwe, yawele ndo Yesu Kilistu, Nguluwi nakawonjezela weng'ha utambichizo na ndolendole za heye. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Ndolendole ya Nguluwi haiwhanile na wihe wa munhu yumwe. Kwa vila munhu yumwe loyaditile gehile, Nguluwi nakatagusa, ila hala lowawifile wanhu wenji, Nguluwi nakegala ndolendole ya kuwadita watanganiche. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Kwa gehile ga munhu yumwe, kubagama nakulongoza kukolela munhu ayo yumwe, ila yangoneka hazelu choyaditile yula munhu yumwe, yawele ndo Yesu Kilistu, ndo chikulu ng'hatu. Weng'ha walingubochela utambichizo na ndolendole ayo yakuwadita wawe watanganiche, wolongoza kuli ukomu kwa kukolela ayo yumwe, yawele ndo Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Lelo, kota vila kwa gehile ga munhu yumwe vyogegale utaguso kwa wanhu weng'ha, hihyo du chinhu chimwe chinojile cha munhu yumwe chowagombola wanhu weng'ha na changuwapa kutanganika na ukomu. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Kulema kuhulichiza kwa munhu yumwe, wanhu weng'ha nawadita gehile, hihyo du kuhulichiza kwa munhu yumwe kawadita wenji wawe watanganiche hali heye Nguluwi.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Malajizo nagalawila, nagambuza konjezeka kwa gehile, ila hala gehile logonjezeche, kunoga kwa heye Nguluwi nakonjezeka ng'hatu. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Kota vila gehile vyogalongoze kwa kubagama, vivyo du utambichizo wa Nguluwi wolongoza kwa gatanganiche na kigala ukomu wa mazuwa gose kwa kukolela Yesu Kilistu Mkulu wa hetwe.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Twangikala tutanganiche kwa chiwalo cha Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Tulonje choni lelo? Ndaze, Tulutilile kusigala kuli gehile leka kunoga kwa heye Nguluwi konjezeche? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Ne hado! Hetwe natubagama, tolutilila ndaze kulongozwa na gehile? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Mina, namvizela kota hetwe tubatizigwe natilumba na Yesu Kilistu, natubatizigwa natilumba kuli kubagama kwa heye. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Lotubatizigwe natilumba kuli kubagama kwa heye na natutiligwa hamwe, leka kota vila Kilistu loyazilipulwe kulawa kwa wanhu wabagame kwa madito makulu ga Mhaza, hetwe natwe tikale kuli ukomu unyale.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Mina, wone hetwe natilumba naye kuli kubagama kota heye, hiho du tochilumba naye kwa kuzilipuligwa kulawa kwa wabagame kota heye. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Kwa vila natuvizela wunhu wa hetwe wa katali nawagazigwa hamwe na Kilistu, leka ludali lwa gehile mulukuli luwifigwe, ahyo tuleche kahi kuwa wapogozi wa gehile. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Mina, munhu yabagame, kagomboligwa kulawa kuli gehile. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Lelo, wone tubagame hamwe na Kilistu, twangukunda tochikala naye hamwe kahi. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Mina, natuvizela Kilistu mina nakazilipulwa kuli wanhu wabagame na hobagama kahi, kubagama hakumlongoza kahi. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ahyo, kwa vila nakabagama kamwe hela, gehile gahela ludali, ukomu woyawele ngikala sambi kangulongozwa na Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ila hemwe kahi miwone mwemwe kota mbagama kwa kulongozwa na gehile, ila mwawakomu kwa Nguluwi kukolela Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Ahyo, gehile galeche kuwalongoza kahi mli ng'huli za hemwe zilingubagama, leka mleche kuwinza maya ga lukuli. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Kahi mleche kulavya vitomo vya hemwe vya lukuli vilongozwe na gehile kota vinhu vya kuditila wihe. Ila milavye hemwe mwemwe kwa Nguluwi kota wanhu wazilipulwe kulawa kwa wanhu wabagame na mlavye ukomu wa hemwe kwa Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha kutanganika. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Mina, gehile hogowalongoza kahi, kwa vila hemwe hamlingulongozwa na malajizo, ila hemwe mwangulongozwa na kunoga kwa heye.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upogozi wa kudita ganojile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Lelo, tulonje choni? Ndaze, tudite gehile kwa vila hatulingulongozwa na malajizo ila twangulongozwa na kunoga kwa heye? Ne hado! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ndangukomya ng'hatu, mvizela wone milavye hemwe mwemwe kota wapogozi na kumhulichiza munhu yunji, hemwe mwanguwa wapogozi wa ayo mlingumhulichiza. Homuwa wapogozi wa gehile momalila kuli kubagama, homuwa wapogozi kwa kumhulichiza Nguluwi, mokoneka mtanganiche kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Hanga namwali wapogozi wa gehile aho katali, ila sambi ndanguta malumbo Nguluwi mhulichiza kwa nhumbula yeng'ha gala gomlonjelwe na malanguso gomgabochele. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Namgomboligwa kulawa muupogozi wa gehile, muwa wapogozi wa utanganiche <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />aha ndangulonga ndonga ya hihi hela ya wanhu kwa chiwalo cha ung'hochele wa hemwe mwemwe. Kwa vila mhela umwe vyomilavile vitomo vya ng'huli za mwemwe kuditila wihe na kuwifya, hihyo du mlavye vitomo vya ng'huli za hemwe kwa kuwadita muwe mwelile.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Lomwali wapogozi wa gehile, namilejeha muwa kutali na kutanganika. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Lelo nampata choni zuwa lila kwa mbuli zila mwanguzonela soni sambi? Mina, golawila kuli mbuli azi ndo kubagama! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ila lelo mina mgomboligwa kulawa kuupogozi wa gehile namuwa vitumagwa wa Nguluwi, chonjezeche kwa hemwe sambi ndo welile na chilawila ndo ukomu wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Mina chonolo cha gehile ndo kubagama, ila ndolendole yalingulavya Nguluwi ndo ukomu wa mazuwa gose kuli kilumba na Yesu Kilistu, Mkulu wa hetwe.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Malajizo ga kihola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Wang'holozangu, ne lunhwinhwi mogazela aga gondilingulonga, mina ndangulonga na wanhu wagazelele malajizo. Malajizo gangumlongoza munhu mhela yawele mkomu. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Kota vila, mdala yaholeche kanguwohigwa na malajizo mhela weng'ha mlume wa heye yang'hali mkomu, ila wone mlume wa heye yabagame, mdala ayo halingulongozwa na malajizo. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Ahyo ayo mdala wone yekale na mlume yunji mhela mlume wa heye yang'hali mkomu, kochemigwa mng'hondwa, ila wone mlume wa heye yabagame, ayo mdala hambe yalongozwe kahi na malajizo, howa mng'hondwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Hiho du namwe wang'holozangu, namwe nambagama kwa chiwalo cha malajizo kwa vila hemwe ndo honhu ha lukuli lwa Kilistu, sambi muwa wanhu wa heye wazilipuligwe kuli wanhu wabagame leka tumditile Nguluwi ganojile. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Mina, lotwali tuchikala aku tulongozwa na lukuli, maya gehile nagambuzwa na malajizo, nagakola mijito mli ng'huli za hetwe na geng'ha gotuditile nagatugalila kubagama. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ila sambi tilejeha kuli malajizo, kwa vila natubagama kwa chiwalo cha mbuli yotuditile hetwe wapogozi. Sambi twangumfugamila Nguluwi mli nzila ya sambi ya Muhe Yelile na haiwele kwa nzila ya katali ya malajizo gandichigwe.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malajizo na gehile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Ndaze, tulonje choni lelo, tulonje malajizo ndo gehile? Ne hado! Ila ne malajizo, heni salikuvizela gehile ndo choni. Mina, salikuvizela ndo choni konela maya gehile, wone malajizo hagalilonga, “Uleche konela maya chinhu cha muyago.” <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Kwa malajizo ago, gehile nagapata honhu ha kuwa na maya mgati mwa heni. Kwa vila ne malajizo gehile gangubagama. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Mhela umwenga heni nandali mkomu ne malajizo, ila mzilo wowuyile, gehile nagenela kahi, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Nani nambagama. Ahyo mzilo awo ulinguganigwa wigale ukomu, ila kwa heni naungalila kubagama. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Kwa vila gehile nagapata honhu ha kutumiya mzilo awo, naganyhada na kung'hopola.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Lelo, malajizo ndo gela na mzilo ndo wela, ndo wa hachi na unoga. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ndaze, chila chinojile chingalila kubagama? Ne hado! Ikoleka hino leka gehile goneche hazelu kota geha, chikoleche chila chinojile na kwambuza kubagama kwa heni. Ahyo gehile, kwa kukolela ula mzilo, nagelajila vyogehile lukami.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondo mgati mwa munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Natuvizela kota malajizo gangulawa kwa muhe, ila heni nda munhu yawele na lukuli, nanguzigwa kota mpogozi wa gehile. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Sivizelele chondilingukola, mina chila chondilingulapa hambe ndichikole, ila chila chondilinguchizudila ndo chondilikudita. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Wone ndilidite lila losiganile kulidita, ndo kota ndangugakunda ng'hatu gala malajizo ndo ganoga. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Lelo, siwele heni nene ndilingudita chinhu acho, ila gala gehile gali mgati mwa heni ndo galingudita ahyo. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Nandivizela haduhu linojile lyoneche mgati mwa heni, kota uwunhu wa heni. Kwa vila hanga ndangugana kudita ganojile, ila ndangulemwela. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Mina silingudita gala ganojile gondigana, ila ndangudita lila lihile lyosiganile. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Lelo, wone ndilidite lila losiganile kulidita, ayi yangilajila siwele heni ndilingudita ago, ila gala gehile gali mgati mwa heni ndo galingudita ahyo.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Lelo, nandigazela malajizo aga, londigana kudita ganojile, ila ndangulifika lila lihile ndo ndilingulihagula. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Mgati ng'hatu mwa nhumbula ya heni ndangusangalalila malajizo ga Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Ila ndangona mna malajizo ganji galingukola mijito mlukuli lwa heni, malajizo ago gangilema na malajizo ga luhala lwangu. Ayo ndo yangundita ndiwe mpogozi wa malajizo gehile galingudita mijito mlukululi lwa heni. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Nda mzunwa heni! Whaani yondohola kuli lukuli alu lulingingalila kubagama? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Malumbo kwa Nguluwi yalingudita ago kwa kukolela kwa Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu! Ahi ndo vyondili heni ndiliyeng'ha, kwa luhala lwa heni, ndangugakolela mijito malajizo ga Nguluwi, ila kwa lukuli lwa heni ndangukolela mijito malajizo gehile.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Kikala kwa ludali lwa Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Ahyo, lelo haduhu utaguso kwa wihe wa wala wawele kuli kikala kwa hewo nawelumba hamwe na Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Mina, malajizo ga Muhe Yelile galingigala ukomu kwa kilumba na Kilistu Yesu nagangombola kulawila kuli malajizo ga gehile na kubagama. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Nguluwi nakaidita mbuli ayo iwele malajizo nakalemwela kudita kwa chiwalo cha ung'hochele wa wanhu. Nguluwi nakamlajiza Mwanage yawele na lukuli kota lwa hetwe tuwele na gehile, kwa lukuli alo nakatagusa gehile. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Nguluwi nakadita kutanganika ako leka kwenela kwa chila chinhu chilinguganigwa kuli malajizo chikoleche mgati mwa hetwe, hetwe tulingikala kwa Muhe Yelile, nahaiwele kwa lukuli luwele na gehile. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Mina, wala walingikala kwa kuwinza vyolugana lukuli, luhala lwao lwangulongozwa na majesa ga mlukuli. Ila wala walingikala vyoyogana Muhe Yelile, luhala lwao lwangulongozwa na majesa ga Muhe. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Majesa ga lukuli gangigala kubagama, ila majesa ga Muhe Yelile gangigala ukomu na kikala goya. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Mina, yalingulongozwa na majesa ga lukuli ndo mng'honyo wa Nguluwi, kwa vila hambe yagahulichize malajizo ga Nguluwi, ne howeza kugahulichiza. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Wanhu walinguwinza maya ga lukuli howoweza kumganiza Nguluwi.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ila hemwe, Muhe wa Nguluwi wone yekale mgati mwa hemwe, hamlongozwa na lukuli, ila mwangulongozwa na Muhe. Wone munhu yoneche kahela Muhe wa Kilistu, ayo hawele wa Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ila wone Kilistu ka mgati mwa hemwe, hanga ng'huli za hemwe zibagama kwa chiwalo cha gehile, kwa hemwe Muhe ndo ukomu kwa vila mditigwa muwe mtanganiche. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Wone Muhe wa Nguluwi yula yamzilipule Kilistu kuli wanhu wabagame kangikala mgati mwa hemwe, lelo ayo yamzilipule Yesu kuli wanhu wabagame kozipa ukomu ng'huli za hemwe zilingoneka za kubagama, kodita ahyo kukolela Muhe wa heye yalingikala mgati mwa hemwe.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Lelo, wang'holozangu, twanayo mbuli, hambe tuganigwe kikala kota ng'huli za hetwe za wihe vyozilingugana kikala. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Kwa vila wone mikale kwa kuwinza lukuli vyolugana ng'hatu mobagama. Ila wone kwa nzila ya Muhe Yelile mogadumya madito ga hemwe gehile, lelo, mowa wakomu. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Mina wala weng'ha walingulongozwa na Muhe wa Nguluwi, awo ndo wana wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Mina hambochele Muhe Yelile leka yalinguwadita hemwe wapogozi kahi mdumbe, ila mbochela Muhe yalinguwadita hemwe wana wa Nguluwi, kwa ludali lwa Muhe ayo, hetwe twangumchema Nguluwi, “Aba,” izeleche “Mhaza!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Naye Muhe wa Nguluwi katawiza na nhumbula za hetwe kota hetwe twa wana wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Lelo, kwa vila hetwe twa wana wa Nguluwi, ahyo tobochela utambichizo weng'ha Nguluwi woyawawichile wanhu wa heye, twanguhaliza hamwe na Kilistu, wone tugaziche naye, vivyo du tuwe hamwe hali ukulu wa heye.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu ulinguya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Ndangona kota magazo ga mhela awu wa sambi ne hado hauwele chinhu wone tuwhanize na ula ukulu woulajilwa kwa hetwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vyangumbeteza ng'hatu Nguluwi yawalajile wana wa heye. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Mina, vilumbigwe naviwikwa vyoneche haviwele chinhu, ila haiwele kwakugana hewo, ila kota navyoyaganile Nguluwi. Leka ahyo wabaho utumbilo, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />mina avyo navyo vilumbigwe vyogomboligwa kulawa kuli upogozi wa kuwifya, vinjile kuli kilejeha kwa ukulu wa wana wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Mina tuvizela mbaka sambi baha, vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vyangulila kwa usungu kota wa kulela mwana. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Kahi haiwele hihyo vilumbigwe viliyeng'ha, ila na hetwe tuwele na ayo Muhe Yelile, yawele wamwaluko wa ndolendole za Nguluwi, natwe twangulila mgati mwa hetwe, aku tubeteza Nguluwi yatudite tuwe wana wa heye, nhumbula za hetwe zigomboligwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Mina kwa utumbilo awu hetwe tuloholigwa. Ila utumbilo wahela chinhu mina wone tuchone chila chotulingitumbila. Mina ndo whaani yalingitumbila chila choyalinguchona? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Wone tulingitumbila chila hatunachona hebu, twangubeteza kwa kwimilila.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Hiho du, naye Muhe Yelile kangututanza kuli ung'hochele wa hetwe. Mina hatuvizelele vyotulinguganigwa kulanda, ila Muhe heye kangutulandila kwa Nguluwi, kwa kung'ung'uta kwa masizo ne kulavya lizi. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Naye Nguluwi yalingulola mbaka mgati mwa nhumbula za hetwe, kavizela majesa ga heye Muhe, kwa vila ayo Muhe Yelile kanguwalandila wanhu wa Nguluwi kwa kuwinza vyoyogana Nguluwi.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Tuvizela kota, kuli mbuli zeng'ha Nguluwi kangukola mijito hamwe na wanhu weng'ha walingumgana, yani wala yawachemile kwa chiwalo cha kugana kwa heye. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Mina awo yawahagule kulawila katali, ndo yawahagule wewhane na Mwanage, leka Mwanage yawe wa mwaluko mli wang'holoze wenji. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Lelo, wala Nguluwi yawahagule ndo wala yawachemile, awo yawachemile ndo wala yawaditile watanganiche ndo awo yawahanzile kahi kuli ukulu wa heye.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igano lya Nguluwi kukolela Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Kwa mbuli azo zeng'ha, tulonje choni lelo? Wone Nguluwi yawele hamwe na hetwe, whaani yoweza kutulemela? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Nguluwi hamonele ne isungu mwanage wa udewele, ila nakamlavya kwa chiwalo cha hetwe tweng'ha. Hanga nakadita ahyo, ndaze, hotugalila kwa kubweda vinhu vyeng'ha hamwe na heye? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Whaani yowalonjeleza wahaguligwe na Nguluwi? Heye Nguluwi yuye nakawakunda kota watanganika! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Whaani yowatagusa kwa wihe? Kuduhu! Mina Kilistu Yesu ndo yabagame, kahi nakazilipuka kuli wanhu wabagame na kangikala ubanzi ya kudilo kwa Nguluwi. Heye ndo yalingutulandila! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Whaani yotubagula na igano lya Kilistu? Ndaze, ndo kugaya ama kugazigwa ama magazo ama nzala ama kwisilwa nguwo ama hali nongwa ama kubagama? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Kwa chiwalo cha hegwe, twangukopoligwa chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">twanguditilwa kota ming'holo jilinguhilikwa kudumuligwa singo.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Ila, kuli mbuli azi zeng'ha, tusumya ng'hatu kwa kukolela heye yatuganile. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Mina ndivizela ng'hatu kota haduhuli chinhu chiweza kutubagula na igano lya heye, ne kubagama ne ukomu ne wahilisi wa kilanga ama wala walingulongoza kilanga ne galingulawila sambi ne golawila hamba ne ludali, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />ne gala gawele kuchanya ne gala gawele hasi ng'hatu. Haduhu choneche chilumbigwe, chiweza kutubagula na igano lya Nguluwi liwele kuli Yesu Kilistu Mkulu wa hetwe.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi na wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ndangulonga ndikomya, heni nda munhu wa Kilistu hambe ndoje udesi. Majesa ga heni golongozwa na Muhe Yelile, yangundonjela mbuli ayi kahi ndeche kulonga udesi. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Ndangugana kulonga ahi, ndina masinzo makulu na usungu wohambe umale mnhumbula ya heni, <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />kwa chiwalo cha wang'holozangu wawele wa nhanzi ya heni! Wone naiwe kwa chiwalo cha lukuli lwa hewo, ndahajezile kulanda kupanjilwa na Nguluwi na kubaguligwa na Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Awo ndo wanhu wa Isilaeli awala Nguluwi nayawahagule wawe wana wa heye, nakawahanhyisa kuli ukulu wa heye, nakadita ilagano nawo, nakuwapa malajizo ga heye, makundo ga kukomya na goyalonjile heye. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Hewo ndo wazukulu wa wasekulu wa Waebulaniya, naye Kilistu, kuli wunhu wa heye, nakalawila kuli lukolo lwa hewo. Nguluwi yalingulongoza hali geng'ha, nayatogoligwe mazuwa gose! Ena.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Hambe ndoje ilagano lya Nguluwi ligaluka, mina haiwele wanhu weng'ha wa Isilaeli ndo wanhu wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Kahi hawawele walelwa weng'ha wa Abulahamu ndo wanage wa kukomya. Ila, kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga, “Walelwa wa heye wolawila kwa Isaka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Mina, haiwele wala wavumbuche chilukuli ndo wana wa Nguluwi, ila wana wala wavumbuche kwa ilagano lya Nguluwi awo ndo wochemigwa wana wa Abulahamu. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Mina ilagano alyo ndo ali, “Mhela utanganiche ndohiluka, naye Sala koponda mwana.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Kahi hagawele ago hela, ila naye Lebeka nakaponda wanyambili kwa mhaza yumwe, heye ndo Isaka, sekulu wa hetwe. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Ila, leka Nguluwi yoneche kota kana ludali lwa kuhagula, hanga kung'hali wala wanyambili hawana pondigwa na lowang'hali kudita linojile ama lihile, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Lebeka nakalonjeligwa kota yula mwana wa mwaluko komkolela mijito yula wakeli. Ahyo Nguluwi kanguhagula kota vyoyogana heye na haiwele vyowogana wanhu halingulola choyalingukola munhu. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga, “Yakubu nandimgana, ila nandimzudila Esau.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Lelo, tulonje choni? Ndaze, Nguluwi kahela hachi? Ne hado! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Mina nakamlonjela Musa, “Ndomlechela munhu yoneche yondilingugana kumlechela na ndomonela isungu munhu yoneche yondigana.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Ahyo, ago geng'ha gangitumbila isungu lya Nguluwi, haiwele kikangaza ama choyalingugana munhu. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Mina Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga ahi kwa Falao, “Nandikudita uwe mndewa kwa kukolela hegwe, leka ndajile ukulu wa heni na itagwa lya heni lizeleche kuli isi yeng'ha.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Ahyo, Nguluwi kangumonela isungu munhu yoneche yalingugana na wone yagane kumdita munhu yawe mjuvi, komdita yawe ahyo.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'halazi na isungu lya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Hanji kombuza, “Wone mbuli za hino, lekachoni Nguluwi kangugona gehile ga hetwe gotulingudita? Whaani yoweza kugabela gala goyalingugana Nguluwi?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ila hegwe munhu, kwa whaani mbaka umuuze Nguluwi? Ndaze chiya chojeza kumuuza yachiwumbile, “Lekachoni unyumbile kota ahi?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Mlumba viya kana ludali lwa kugongomanyila ilongo lyoyalingugana na kuwumba viya vili kwa ilongo lilila, chimwe kwa mbuli ng'hulu na chinji kwa mbuli ndodo.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Ahyo ndo vyoiwele kwa Nguluwi. Nakagana kulajila ng'halazi ya heye na kulajila ludali lwake. Ila nakawemilila wanhu wala nawaganigwe kudumigwa na ng'halazi ya heye. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Heye yuye nakagana kuulajila winji wa ukulu wa heye woyatujidile hetwe tuganigwe kubochela isungu lya heye, hetwe mina yatuwichile goya kulawila katali tubochela ukulu wa heye. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Mina hetwe ndo wala nayawachemile, haiwele kulawila kuli Wayahudi yeng'ha ila kahi kulawila kuli wanhu wa isi zinji. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Kota Mkulu navyoyalonjile mli chitabu cha mloli Hoseya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Wala, ‘Nahawawele wanhu wa heni’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">ndowachema, ‘Wanhu wa heni!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Naye ‘Sikuganile’ kochemigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">‘Mganwa wa heni,’<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Hanga Nguluwi nakawalonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Hemwe hamuwele wanhu wa heni’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">aho wochemigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Wana wa Nguluwi yawele mkomu.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Vivila mloli Isaya, nakalonga kwa usungu kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa Isilaeli, “Wone wanhu wa Isilaeli ndo wenji kota misanga ja kumwhani, ndo wado hela woloholigwa, <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Mkulu hokawila kutagusa himahima isi yeng'ha.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Kota Isaya vyoyalongole kulonga, “Kota Mkulu wa wamizi hatulechele wana wamwe wa Isilaeli, twahawele kota Sodoma, twahewhanile na Gomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kanguwalandila Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Lelo tulonje choni? Wanhu wa isi zinji hawaditile chinhu leka wawe watanganiche, nawaditikwa wawe watanganiche, kwa makundo ga hewo, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />ila wanhu wa Isilaeli wala nawapalile malajizo ga kuwadita wawe watanganiche, nahawagawene. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Lekachoni lelo? Kwa vila nawetumbila madito ga hewo honhu ha kitumbila makundo. Ahyo, nawekwang'wala hali iganga lya kikwang'wala, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />kota vyogalingulonga Maandiko Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Ulole, ndowika iganga ako Siyoni alyo lyanguwadita wanhu kikwang'wala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">mbika mgamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">ulinguwadita wanhu wagwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">Ila munhu yoneche yomkunda hobasigwa soni hebu!”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Wang'holozangu, kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha ndangugana kuwalandila kwa Nguluwi Waisilaeli wayangu waloholigwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Mina ndangutawiza hewo welavya kumgana Nguluwi. Ila nahawavizelele kudita navyoyaliyogana Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Mina hawavizelele hila Nguluwi vyoyalinguwadita wanhu wawe watanganiche, nawo waluchiza vihendo vya hewo wawo na hawaikundile ayo nzila ya Nguluwi ya kuwadita wawe watanganiche. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Mina kwa kuya kwa heye Kilistu, malajizo nagaduma, leka weng'ha walingukunda wawe watanganiche.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulohozi kwa wanhu weng'ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Kulapa kuwa utanganiche kwa kuwinza malajizo, Musa nakandika ahi, “Munhu yoneche yalinguhulichiza malajizo kochikala.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Ila kwa mbuli ya kutanganika hali meho ga Nguluwi kwa nzila ya makundo, Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga hino, “Uleche kulonga mnhumbula mwa hegwe, ‘Whaani yokwina mbaka kilanga,’ ako ndo kumdulisa Kilistu? <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Ne uleche kulonga, ‘Whaani yodulika mbaka kuli isi ya wabagame,’ ako ndo kumigala Kilistu kulawa kuli wanhu wabagame?” <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga ahi, “Ulonzi awo wa Nguluwi wahabehi na hegwe, wa hamlomo wa hegwe na mnhumbula ya hegwe” nawo ndo gala makundo gotulingudamla. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Houvumila kwa mlomo wa hegwe kuta Yesu ndo Mkulu na kukunda mnhumbula ya hegwe kuta Nguluwi nakamzilipula kuli wanhu wabagame, koloholigwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Mina munhu kangukunda kwa nhumbula kanguditigwa yatanganiche na kuvumila kwa mlomo leka yaloholigwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga, “Chila yalingumkunda hobasigwa soni.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Mbuli ayi ndo kwa weng'ha, mina haduhu yalivinji hali Wayahudi na hawawele Wayahudi, kwa vila Nguluwi ka Mkulu kwa wanhu weng'ha, naye kana isungu ng'hatu kwa weng'ha walingumchema. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Kwa vila Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga, “Ahyo wanhu weng'ha howolanda kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi woloholigwa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Lelo, womlanda ndaze heye yula hambe wamkunde? Kahi, womkunda ndaze yula hawanahulika mbuli za heye? Wohulika ndaze mbuli za heye wone kuduhu munhu yalingudamla? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Wanhu wodamla ndaze wone hawatumigwe? Kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga, “Ndo mbuli ya kunojeza lukami kuya kwa wala walingudamla Mbuli Inojile!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ila haiwele wanhu weng'ha waikundile Mbuli Inojile. Mina Isaya nakalonga, “Mkulu, ndo whaani yaukundile usenga wa hetwe?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Ahyo lelo, makundo ganguya kwa kuhulika usenga, nawo usenga wanguya kwa ulonzi wa Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Lelo ndanguuza, ndaze, hawauhuliche awo usenga? Ena, nawauhulika, kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“Lizi lya hewo nalyenela kuli isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">na ulonzi wa hewo naufika mbaka kuli kuduma kwa isi yeng'ha.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Kahi ndanguuza, hambi wanhu wa Isilaeli nahawavizelele? Musa heye nakalongola kwidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Ndokuditani muwonele maya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">wanhu wa isi inji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">ndokuditani muwang'hang'halile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">wanhu wapoka.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Kahi Isaya hadumbile kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">“Wala wanhu wawele hawamhalile nawambona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">ndilajila kwa wanhu wala hawamhalile.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ila kwa mbuli ya Isilaeli, Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">“Nemisi yeng'ha nandiwagololela moko ga heni wanhu hawalingunyhulichiza na wajuvi.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Isungu lya Nguluwi kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Lelo, ndanguuza, ndaze, Nguluwi nakawalema wanhu wa heye? Ne hado! Hawalemile hebu! Heni nda Muisilaeli, mlelwa wa Abulahamu, nda munhu wa nhanzi ya Benjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Nguluwi hawalemile wanhu wa heye nayawahagule kulawila mwaluko. Mwangukumbuka vyogalingulonga Maandiko Matakatifu kuwala Eliya mhela yamng'ung'utile Nguluwi kwa mbuli ya Isilaeli, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />“Mkulu, wawakopola waloli wa hegwe na kubomola honhu ha kulavila nhambiko za hegwe. Ndo heni ndiliyeka mhonile, nawo wangugana kung'hopola!” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Ndaze, Nguluwi nakamwidichila choni? Nakamlonjela, “Nandiwichila wanhu elufu saba (7,000) wawele hawamfugamile Baali.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Lelo, ndo vyoiwele mhela awu wa sambi, wabaho wanhu wala Nguluwi yawahagule kwa chiwalo cha isungu kwa heye. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Ila wone nawahaguligwa kwa isungu, haiwele kahi kwa kuwinza madito. Mina, wone uhaguzi wa heye nawitumbile madito ga wanhu, isungu lya heye hanalyali isungu kahi.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Sambi, ndaze? Wanhu wa Isilaeli hawachiwene chila chowali wochipala, ila weng'ha wahaguligwe nawachona. Wanji nawambuzwa nhumbula za hewo ziwe zigagadale, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />kota vyogalingulonga Maandiko Matakatifu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">“Nguluwi kazidita nhumbula za hewo zigagadale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">na mbaka lehano hambe walole kwa meho ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">ne kuhulika kwa makutu ga hewo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Naye Daudi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Visaga vya hewo viwe idiwa lya kuwagwiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">wagwe na kugazigwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Meho ga hewo gawichigwe jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">leka walemwele kulola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">Migongo ja hewo jibinuche mazuwa gose!”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Lelo, ndanguuza, hambi Wayahudi wekwang'hwala mbaka wagwa ng'hatu? Ne hado! Ila kwa gehile ga hewo ulohozi nauya kwa wanhu wa isi zinji, leka Wayahudi wawonele maya. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ila gehile ga Wayahudi gambuza kuya utambichizo winji kwa isi yeng'ha na nongwa za hewo, zigala utambichizo winji kwa wanhu wa isi zinji. Lelo, Wayahudi weng'ha wone wamgalamchile Nguluwi, utambichizo wokonjezeka ng'hatu.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulohozi wa wanhu wa isi zinji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Lelo, ndanguwalonjelani hemwe wanhu wa isi zinji. Kwa vila heni nda mtumigwa kwa wanhu wa isi zinji, ndangidayila vyondilingudita, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />ndangugana ndiwadite wanhu wayangu wakoneleni hemwe maya, leka mbeze kuwalohola wamwenga. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Mina kwa kulemigwa kwa hewo nakuwadita wanhu wahanyiswe na Nguluwi, yowa ndaze mhela lowokundigwa na Nguluwi? Wabagame wozilipuka!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Wone chihande cha mwaluko cha ibumunda nachiwichigwa chiuyeng'ha, ibumunda lyeng'ha lyanguwa liwichigwe chiuyeng'ha, mizabi ja migodi wone jinoje na nhagala za igodi ziwaga zinojile kahi. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Ena, nhagala zimwe za mzeituni mkagunda nazitemigwa na honhu hake hawichigwa na kuwohigwa nhagala ya mzeituni wa kisolo naiwichigwa. Hemwe wanhu wa isi zinji mwangiwhana na mzeituni wa kisolo na sambi mwangihanza hamwe na unhovu wa igodi lya mzeituni. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Lelo, mleche kuwabeza wala watemigwe kota nhagala! Na wone lyakuko lya kidayila, mkumbuchile kota hamuwele hemwe mlingujimiza ajo mizabi, ila mizabi ndo jilinguwemiza hemwe.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ila molonga, “Nhagala nazitemigwa leka heni mbichigwe honhu hake.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Goya! Nazitemigwa kwa chiwalo cha kwanjila makundo, ila hegwe kwangwima kwa makundo ga hegwe. Ila uleche kidaya, leka wime kwa kudumba. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Mina, wone Nguluwi hawonele isungu Wayahudi wewhanile na nhagala za chaluchizo, ndaze, Nguluwi kokonela isungu hegwe?<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Lelo mlole, Nguluwi vyoyawele na isungu na vyoyang'hang'hale. Heye kang'hang'hala kwa wala wagwile, ila kana isungu kwa hemwe wone mlutilila kikala mli igano lya heye, ila wone hebu, vivila namwe motemigwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Nawo Wayahudi, hihyo, wone waleche wihe wa hewo wa makundo, wohiluswa honhu hala ha mwaluko. Mina Nguluwi koweza kudita ahyo. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Hemwe wanhu wa isi zinji, kwa chaluchizo mfanda kota nhagala za mzeituni wa kisolo, ila musigwa ako, muwichigwa kuli mzeituni mkagunda honhu hala kwa chaluchizo hahawele ha hemwe. Ila Wayahudi kwa chaluchizo ndo kota mzeituni mli kamgunda na yowa mbuli ya ubewe ng'hatu kwa hewo kuwichigwa na kuwohigwa kahi muli igodi lya mzeituni.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kanguwonela isungu wanhu weng'ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Wang'holozangu ndangugana mvizele ng'hatu kukomya kuvisigwe mleche kiwona mna luhala lukami. Usugu wa Wayahudi wali wa mhela udo hela mbaka wanhu hawawele Wayahudi lowowa wamhiluchile Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Aho Waisilaeli weng'ha woloholigwa, kota vyogalingulonga Maandiko Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Mlohozi kokuya kulawila Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">kowusa wihe wa lukolo lwa walelwa wa Yakubu.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Ali ndo ilagano lyondilingudita na hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">mhela wondikusa wihe wa hewo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Kwa vila wanguilema Mbuli Inojile, Wayahudi nawawa wang'honyo wa Nguluwi, ila kwa lutogo lwa hemwe wanhu hawawele Wayahudi. Ila kwa vila nawahaguligwa na Nguluwi, wang'hali woganigwa na Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha wasekulu wa hewo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Mina Nguluwi wone yawape ndolendole za hewo na kuwahagula, hambe mng'ung'utile chila choyaditile. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Aho mwaluko hemwe namleka kumhulichiza Nguluwi ila sambi mpegwa isungu lya heye, kwa hewo Wayahudi kaleka kumhulichiza Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Vivila kota hemwe lombochele utambichizo, Wayahudi nawo sambi, wangumleka Nguluwi leka hewo nawo wabochele isungu lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Mina Nguluwi kawawoha wanhu weng'ha kuli kubelenhuka kwa hewo leka yawonele isungu weng'ha.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi yatogoligwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Lufufu na luhala na uwanzi wa Nguluwi ndo lukulu lukami. Utaguso wa heye hambe upugajizwe na nzila za heye hazilinguzeleka. Kota vyogalingulonga Maandiko Matakatifu.<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />“Whaani yajezile kugazela Majesa ga Mkulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Whaani yolongasa naye?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Ama ndo whaani yalongole kumha chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">naye Nguluwi yamhilusile chinhu acho?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Kwa vila vinhu vyesa vyangulawa kwa heye, vyabaho kukolela heye na kwa chiwalo cha heye. Ukulu na uwe kwa heye mazuwa gose! Ena.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Ukomu kuli uchitumagwa wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Ahyo, wang'holozangu, kwa vila Nguluwi kana isungu lukami, ndangukulandani kwa nhumbula yeng'ha, mumlavile Nguluwi lukuli lwa hemwe kota nhambiko iling'homu, yelile na ilingunojeza. Aku ndo kumfugamila Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Mleche kwiga chihendo cha isi ayi, leka Nguluwi yawadite muwe mnojile mgati mwenu kwa kugalamla nyhala za hemwe. Aho ndo homvizela kugana kwa Nguluwi na kuvizela mbuli iwele inojile, ilingumnojeza na yenele.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Kwa utambichizo woyamhele Nguluwi, ndangukulonjelani hemwe mweng'ha, chila munhu yaleche kiwona mkulu kusinda vila vyoyalinguganigwa. Kijesa kwa hemwe na kuwe na chasi kota Nguluwi vyoyamgawile chila munhu makundo ga heye. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Lukuli luna vitomo vinji, chila chitomo chimwe changukola mijito jake. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Hiho du natwe hanga twawenji, twa lukuli lumwe kwa kilumba na Kilistu na chila yumwe ndo chitomo cha myage. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Lelo, twanao uwanzi winji kota vila kunoga kwa heye kotupeligwe. Yawele na ndolendole ya uloli na yauditile kota makundo ga heye vyogali. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Munhu yawele na ndolendole ya uchitumagwa na yaudite. Munhu yawele na ndolendole ya kulangusa na yalanguse. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Munhu yawele na ndolendole ya kuwahembuliza wanji nayadite ahyo. Munhu yalingumgawila myage choyawelenacho nayadite ahyo kwa isungu. Munhu yawele chilongozi na yalongoze kwa kwimilila, naye munhu yalingudita mbuli ya isungu nayadite ahyo kwa kusangalala.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Igano lya hemwe liwe hela udesi woneche. Mzudile mbuli yoneche yihile, mibatilile linojile. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Migane chilukolo, mihulichize hemwe kwa hemwe, chila yumwe yaluche kumjesa myage kwa kumuhulichiza. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Mleche kuwa wagata kuli kumkolela mijito Mkulu, ila muwe msangalale kuli nhumbula za hemwe zeng'ha kuli kumfugamila Mkulu. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Kitumbila kwa hemwe kukuwicheni chila zuwa msangalale, namuwe na ubetezo kuli kugaya na kumlanda Nguluwi mhela weng'ha. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Muwatanze wanhu wa Nguluwi kuli chila chowolanda, muwabochele wajenzi kwa luhala.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Muwatambichize wala weng'ha walinguwabunza hemwe, ena, muwatambichize na mleche kuwapanjila. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Msangalale hamwe na wawele ngusangalala, mlile hamwe na wala walingulila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Mikale hamwe kwa kihanyisa. Mleche kidaya, ila mkunde kikala na wanhu wawele wazunwa. Mleche kiwona ndo muwele na luhala lukami.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Mleche kumuhilulila munhu lihile kwa lihile. Mdite mbuli zinojile hali wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Kota vyoilingulapigwa kikala goya na wanhu weng'ha, muwe na igano kwa wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Waganwa wa heni, mleche kihilulila chibida, ila mlecheleni Nguluwi mbuli ayo, mina Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga, “Kuhilula chibida ndo kwa chiwalo cha heni, nani ndohilula chibida, Mkulu kangulonga.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Kupuluta kwa ago, Maandiko gangulonga, “Wone mng'honyo wa hegwe kana nzala, umhe chilyo, wone yawe na ng'halu, umhe chinhu cha kunwa yanwe. Mina kwa kudita ahyo komdita yone usungu mnhumbula kota makala ga chiluli mchanya muli mutwi wa heye.”<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Uleche kukunda kusumigwa na wihe, ila usumye wihe kwa kudita mbuli zinojile.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Kuwahulichiza vilongozi wa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Chila munhu kangulapigwa kuwahulichiza walingulongoza isi, kwa vila kuduhu munhu yolongoza wone Nguluwi hamlechile yalongoze, Nguluwi yaliyeka ndo yalinguwapa vilongozi ludali lwa kulongoza. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Yalingubeza ludali lwa vilongozi kangubeza ilajizo lya Nguluwi, nawo walingudita ahyo wotagusigwa. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Mina walingulongoza hambewambuze kudumba kwa wanhu wanojile, ila kwa wanhu wehile. Lelo, kwangugana uleche kumdumba munhu yawele na ludali? Udite ganojile naye kokutogola, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />mina heye ndo chitumagwa wa Nguluwi yalingukola mijito kwa mbuli ya hegwe inojile. Ila wone udite gehile, lelo, yokulapa kudumba, mina heye ng'hatu kana ludali lwa kukugaza. Heye chitumagwa wa Nguluwi, kuwalajila kuzudila kwa heye kwa wala walingudita wihe. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ahyo ndo yangulapigwa kuwahulichiza wakulu wa isi wali na ludali, haiwele kwa chiwalo cha kudumba kuzudila kwa Nguluwi, leka kahi kwa vila nhumbula ya hegwe yovizela choulingugana kudita.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Kwa chiwalo chicho hemwe mwangulavya kodi, mina vilongozi wa isi wangumkolela mijito Nguluwi hanga wangukola gala gawele nguwalapa. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Mumhe chila munhu hachi ya heye, munhu wa ushulu, yapegwe ushulu na munhu wa kodi yapegwe kodi na yalingudumbigwa nayadumbigwe na yalingugana katogo na yatogoligwe.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Migane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Mleche kudaigwa na munhu yoneche, ila migane. Yalingumgana yoyalingikala habehi na heye, kanguwinza malajizo. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Mina malajizo aga, “Uleche ung'hondwa na uleche kukopola na uleche konela maya” na zinji zoneche, zamumo mli ilajizo ali limwe, “Mgane yalingikala habehi na hegwe kota vyoulingigana gwegwe.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Yalingumgana yalingikala habehi na heye hambe yamditile vibi. Lelo, igano ndo kwenela kwa malajizo.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Mzidi wa ago, hemwe sambi mvizela kota twa mli mhela wachi. Sambi ndo mhela wa kulilimka, ena, ulohozi wa hetwe wahabehi ng'hatu sambi kusinda mhela wula wotwaluche kukunda. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Nechilo yangumala na nemisi yahabehi kwinjila. Lelo, tuleche kudita wihe wa jiza, tudite ganojile ga lumuli. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Tikale goya kota wanhu walingikala nemisi, haiwele kwa kulya lukami na kugala na wavu na ung'hondwa na kilewa na maya. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Lelo milumbe na Mkulu Yesu Kilistu, hamba mleche kuwinza maya ga ng'huli za hemwe vyozilingugana.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Uleche kumtagusa mng'holozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Mumbochele haluga henu munhu yawele na makundo mado, ila mleche kitwanza naye kuwala majesa ga heye yaliyeka. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Wanhu hawewhanile. Yumwe makundo ga heye gangumkundiza kulya chila chinhu, ila yunji yawele makundo ga heye ndo mado, kangulya mboga hela. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Munhu yalingulya chila chinhu yaleche kumbeza yula yalingulemwela kulya chila chinhu, naye yalingulya mboga hela, yaleche kumtagusa yalingulya chila chinhu, mina Nguluwi nakamkunda. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Hegwe ndo whaani mbaka ujeze kumtagusa chitumagwa wa yunji? Wone yeme ama yagwe acho ndo choyaganile Mkulu wa heye, ena, kokwima nzinzili, mina Mkulu kanguweza kumwimiza.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Munhu kangijesa kota zuwa limwe litanganika kusinda zuwa linji, yunji kangijesa kota mazuwa gose gewhana. Chila yumwe yawinze kwimilila kwa luhala lwa heye. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Yula yalinguwaza zuwa limwenga litanganiche, kangudita ahyo kwa chiwalo cha kumtogola Nguluwi, naye yalingulya chilyo chimwenga kangudita ahyo kwa kumtogola Mkulu, mina kanguta malumbo Nguluwi kwa chilyo choyampele. Hiho du naye yalinguleka kulya chilyo chimwenga, ayo kangudita kwa chiwalo cha kumtogola Mkulu, naye kahi kangumtogola Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Mina haduhu munhu yoneche hali hetwe yalingikala kwa chiwalo cha heye yuye, kahi haduhu yalingubagama kwa chiwalo cha heye yuye, <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />mina wone tikale twangikala kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu, wone tubagame, twangubagama kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu. Lelo, wone tuwe wakomu ama tubagame, hetwe ndo lufufu lwa heye Mkulu. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Mina Kilistu nakabagama, nakazilipuka leka yawe Mkulu wa wakomu na wabagame. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Lekachoni, hegwe kwangumtagusa mng'holozo? Nagwe, lekachoni ulingumbeza mng'holozo? Hetwe tweng'ha tokwima hali chigoda cha utaguso cha Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Mina Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">Mkulu kangulonga, “Kota vyondilingikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">chila munhu kofugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">na chila munhu kovumila kuta heni nda Nguluwi.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Ahyo lelo, chila yumwe wa hetwe, kokwidichila kwa chiwalo cha madito ga heye yuye hali Nguluwi.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uleche kumwambuza yumwe wa hetwe yajilile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Lelo, tuleche kitagusa, ila tilolele tuleche kuwa chambuzo cha wang'holozetu kikwang'wala ama kuwambuza wagwe mli gehile. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Kuli kilumba na Mkulu Yesu, ndivizela ng'hatu kuwa kuduhu chinhu choneche chikokomoche kochaluchile, ila, wone munhu yone chinhu chimwe chikokomoka, lelo, kwa heye chikokomoka. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Lelo wone mng'holozo kangisinza kwa chilyo choulingulya, lelo, hegwe kwahela igano. Chilyo choulingulya chileche kuwa chambuzo cha kwajilila mng'holozo, yula Kilistu yabagame kwa chiwalo cha heye! <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Lelo, mleche kukunda chinhu chomulinguchona chinojile chikovuligwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Mina Undewa wa Nguluwi hauwele kwa chinhu cha kulya na kunwa, ila wangulapa kutanganika na kikala goya na kusangalala kulingigaligwa na Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Mina munhu yoneche yalingumkolela mijito Kilistu kota ahi, kangumnojeza Nguluwi na kangukundigwa na wanhu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ahyo mibatilile mbuli zilingigala kikala goya na galingutanza kizenga mwemwe baho. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Lelo, uleche kuwifya mijito ja Nguluwi kwa kiziganila chilyo. Vilyo vyesa vinoga, ila haiwele goya munhu kulya chilyo choneche chimwambuza munhu yunji yagwe kuli gehile. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Chiba kuleka kulya miwunde na kunwa divai ama kudita choneche chila chlingwambuza mng'holozo yagwe kuli gehile. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Lelo, wibatilile choulingukunda hegwe na Nguluwi wa hegwe. Kobweda munhu yula yawele ngugana yuye chakudita, kwa vila vinhu vyowalingijesa kota vinoga. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ila yula munhu yalingijesa kwa chiwalo cha chila chilyo choyalingulya, kangutaguswa kwa wihe wone yalye, mina hadile kwa makundo. Choneche wone munhu hambe yadite kwa makundo acho ndo gehile.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Wanojeze wanji uleche kinojeza gwegwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Hetwe tuwele na makundo makulu twangulapigwa kuwatanza wala wawele na makundo mado wesumwe na ung'hochele wa hewo. Tuleche kinojeza hetwe tuliyeka. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Chila munhu kangulapigwa kumnojeza yoyalingikala habehi na heye kwa isungu leka ayo yadahe kizenga kuli makundo. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Mina Kilistu henojeze yaliyeka, ila nayali kota vyogalingulonga Maandiko, “Maligo geng'ha kowakulijile hegwe gambuyila heni.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Mina, geng'ha gandichigwe katali nagandichigwa kwa chiwalo cha kutulangusa hetwe kwa ubetezo na kikangaza kotulingupegwa na ago Maandiko Matakatifu tuwe na lya kitumbila. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Nguluwi nayali mwaluko wa ubetezo na yalinguwapa hemwe lunojenoje lweng'ha, yakuganileni hemwe muwe na chinhu chimwe kota heye Kilistu Yesu navyoyali, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />leka hemwe mweng'ha, kwa nhumbula imwe na lizi limwe, mtogoleni Nguluwi, Mhaza wa Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli Inojile kwa wanhu weng'ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Lelo, michemele hemwe kota heye Kilistu vyoyawachemile hemwe leka Nguluwi yatogoligwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Mina, ndangukulonjelani Kilistu nayali chitumagwa kwa Wayahudi leka yalajile kukomya kwa Nguluwi, leka gala malagano yawichile Nguluwi kwa wasekulu wa hetwe gakoleche kwa kukomya, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />leka nawo wanhu wa isi zinji leka wamzele na kumtogola Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha isungu lya heye. Kota vyogalingulonga Maandiko Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Ahyo ndokutogola hali wanhu wa isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">Ndokwimba lutogo lwa itagwa lyako.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Kahi Maandiko gangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">“Msangalale, hemwe wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">msangalale hamwe na wanhu wa heye.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Kahi, gangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">“Hemwe wanhu wa isi zeng'ha, mumtogole Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">hemwe wanhu weng'ha, mumtogole.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Kahi mloli Isaya kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">“Kuli lukolo lwa Yese kulawila munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">naye kowalongoza wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">nawo womtumbila.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Lelo, Nguluwi nayali chaluko cha kitumbila, yakumemezeni usangalalo weng'ha na kikala goya kwa makundo ga hemwe, kitumbila kwa hemwe konjezeche kwa mong'ho wa Muhe Yelile.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mijito ja Paoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Wang'holozangu, heni ndivizela ng'hatu kota hemwe mmema kunoga na luhala lweng'ha, moweza kilangusa hemwe mliyeng'ha. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Ila nandikwandichilani kuli baluwa ayi vinhu vinji ne kudumba, leka ndikukumbuseni mbuli zimwenga. Nandita ahyo kwa isungu lyoyamhele Nguluwi, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />leka ndiwe kota chitumagwa wa Yesu Kilistu kwa wanhu wa isi. Ndangiditila kota mtambika kudamla Mbuli Inojile ya Nguluwi leka wanhu wa isi zinji wawe nhambiko ikundigwe na Nguluwi, nhambiko yelizwe na Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ahyo, ndiwele ndilumbile na Kilistu Yesu, ndoweza kidayila madito ga heni kwa chiwalo cha Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Hambe njeze kulonga chinhu chinji choneche ila chila hela Kilistu Yesu choyaditile kwa kung'holela heni leka wanhu wa isi wamhulichize heye. Nakadita ahyo kwa ulonzi na madito, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />kwa ludali lwa vinduzanduza na kububuwaza na kwa ludali lwa Muhe wa Nguluwi. Lelo, kwa majendo ga chila honhu, kwaluchila kula Yelusalemu mbaka isi ya Iluliko, nandiwadamlila ng'hangaze Mbuli Inojile ya Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Chondilingugana heni mazuwa geng'ha, ndamle Mbuli Inojile hali isi zila Kilistu halinguzeleka, leka ndeche kuzenga hali msisi uwichigwe na munhu yunji. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Kota vyogalingulonga Maandiko Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">“Wanhu weng'ha hawalonjelwe mbuli za heye, wokona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">nawo wala wawele hawanahulika mbuli za heye wovizela.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangugana kujendela Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Kwa chiwalo acho mazuwa menji nandemezwa kuya kwa hemwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Kwa vila sambi nasinda mijito ja heni kuli isi azi, kwa vila kwa mihela minji nangana ng'hatu kuya kwa hemwe kuwalolani, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Ndangugana kudita ahyo sambi. Ndowajendelani ndiwele mmajendo kuluta Sipaniya na ndangugana hemwe kunhanza fiche ako, hondisinda kusangalala kikala na hemwe mhela udo. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Ila, kwa sambi ndanguluta kuwaditila uchitumagwa wanhu wa Nguluwi kula Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Mina wanhu wa Makedoniya na wanhu wa Akaya wangugana kuwatanza wanhu wa Nguluwi wawele wazunwa ako Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Hewo wawo nawagana kudita ahyo, ila nawaganigwa kudita ahyo. Mina, wone wanhu wa isi zinji wangubochela utambichizo wa chimuhe kulawila kwa Wayahudi, nawo wangulapigwa kuwatanza Wayahudi kuli chila chowogana hewo cha muisi. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Londisinda kukola mijito ajo na kuwapa Wayahudi chila chikongozigwe kwa chiwalo cha hewo, ndokujendelani hemwe londiwa mmajendo kuluta Sipaniya. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Ndanguvizela kota londikuya kwa hemwe ndokugalilani utambichizo winji wa Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Lelo, wang'holozangu, ndanguwalanda kwa Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu na kwa igano lya Muhe Yelile, muwe na heni kuli kundandila kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Mndandile ndawe goya muli wala wohambe wamkunde Kilistu wawele Uyahudi, mndandile mijito ja heni jiwe goya ako Yelusalemu jikundigwe na wanhu wa Nguluwi wawele ako Yudeya. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Ahyo, wone Nguluwi yagane, hanji ndokuya kwa hemwe kwa nhumbula isangalale, ndikesele hamwe na hemwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Nguluwi yawele yaluchize kikala goya yawe hamwe na hemwe! Ena!<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Paoli kanguwalamsa wanhu wawele Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ndangugana kumzelesa kwa hemwe lumbulyetu Foebe yula yawele ndo chitumagwa kuli chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu chiwele ako Kenikilea. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mbocheleni kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu kota vyowalingubocheligwa wanhu wa Nguluwi. Mumtanze choneche choyolanda kwa hemwe, mina heye kanoga ng'hatu kwa wanhu wenji na kwa heni.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Mndamsile Pilisika na Akula, wakola mijito wayangu kuli uchitumagwa wa Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Hewo nawagana wakopoligwe kwa chiwalo cha heni. Wangulapigwa kulonjelwa malumbo, haiwele kwa heni yeka ila kahi kulawila kwa vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu wa isi zinji. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Mndamsile kahi chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu weng'ha, walingiting'hana haluga hawo. Mndamsile goloko wa heni Epaineto yula yawele yomkunda Kilistu wa mwaluko kuli mkowa wa Asiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Mndamsile Maliya yula nayakolile mijito kwa kikangaza kwa chiwalo cha hemwe. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Mndamsile Andolonikasi na Yunia, wanhu wa isi wayangu wotuwohigwe mchinweng'ho hamwe na heni, hewo wazeleka goya mli watumigwa, nawo wali walongole kumkunda Kilistu heni londing'hali.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Mndamsile Ampiliato, goloko wa heni kuli kilumba na Mkulu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Mndamsile Ulubano, mkola mijito myangu kuli uchitumagwa wa Kilistu, vivila mndamsile kahi goloko wa heni Sitaku. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Mndamsile Apelesi yula yazeleche kota wa kukomya kwa heye Kilistu. Mndamsile wanhu weng'ha wawele muli ng'handa ya Alisitobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Mndamsile mng'holozangu Helodiana, Muwalamse weng'ha wawele kaye kwa Nalikisi welumbile na wanhu wamkundile Mkulu.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Mndamsile Tilufena na Tilufosa walingukola mijito kuli uchitumagwa wa Mkulu na goloko wa heni Pelisi yula nayaditile menji kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Mndamsile Lufo, munhu yahaguligwe kuli mijito ja Mkulu na mayake yawele nani ndo mayangu. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Mndamsile Asunikilito na Filegoni na Helime na Patiloba na Helima na wang'holoze weng'ha wawele hamwe na hewo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Mndamsile Filologo na Yulia na Nelea na lumbulye na Olimpa na wanhu weng'ha wa Nguluwi wawele hamwe na hewo.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Milamse kwa kulajila igano lya Kilistu. Mwangulamswa na chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu weng'ha.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga kugwisa chilasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Wang'holozangu, ndanguwalanda milolele na wala weng'ha walingwambuza wayao webagule na kuwadita wanhu wanji wagwe, waleche kibata malanguso gomlanguswe. Mikale kutali na wanhu awo, <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />mina wanhu wali ahyo hambe wamkolele mijito Kilistu Mkulu wa hetwe, ila nawajikolela mijito mida ja hewo wawo. Kwa ulonzi wa hewo wa usugu na kudamla kwa hewo kwa kuhembuliza leka kwajiliza nhumbula za wanhu wanojile. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Chila munhu nakahulika kuhulichiza kwa hemwe kuli mbuli inojile ne nongwa ilingulapa kudita mbuli zihile. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Naye Nguluwi nayali chaluko cha kikala goya hokawila kulihondanga Limazoga hasi hali magulu ga hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:20">Kunoga kwa heye Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu kuwe na hemwe.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoteyi, mkola mijito muyangu, kangukulamsani. Kahi na Lukio na Yasoni na Sosipetili na wanhu wayangu, wangukulamsani.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nani Telitio, ndilingwandika baluwa ayi, ndangukulamsani kwa itagwa lya Mkulu.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayo mwenyeng'haye wa heni na chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu weng'ha walingiting'hana kwa heye, kangukulamsani. Elasito, muwika lufufu lwa muji awu, hamwe na mng'holozetu Kwato, wangukulamsani. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Utambichizo wa Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu uwe na hemwe mweng'ha. Ena.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa chiwalo cha kumtogola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Lelo, sambi tumtogole Nguluwi! Heye kanguweza kuwadita hemwe mwime nzinzili kuli ila Mbuli Inojile yondamle ya Yesu Kilistu na kuli ula uviso ugubuligwe na nawali uvisigwe kulawila katali. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Ila, sambi kukomya ako nakugubuligwa kwa kukolela gandichigwe na waloli na kwa malajizo ga Nguluwi wa mazuwa gose nawilajila kwa wanhu wa isi zeng'ha leka wanhu weng'ha wakunde na wahulichize.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Kuli ukulu wa heye Nguluwi nayali yaliyeka yawele na luhala, yatambichizwe kwa nzila ya kukolela Yesu Kilistu, mazuwa gose! Ena.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>